{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function deepEquals(a, b): boolean;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/utils.ts#L29","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/db/src/utils.ts:29"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Deep equality function that compares two values recursively\nHandles primitives, objects, arrays, Date, RegExp, Map, Set, TypedArrays, and Temporal objects"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"a","children":[{"type":"text","value":"a"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"any"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"First value to compare"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"b","children":[{"type":"text","value":"b"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"any"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Second value to compare"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"True if the values are deeply equal, false otherwise"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"deepEquals({ a: 1, b: 2 }, { b: 2, a: 1 }) // true (property order doesn't matter)\ndeepEquals([1, { x: 2 }], [1, { x: 2 }]) // true\ndeepEquals({ a: 1 }, { a: 2 }) // false\ndeepEquals(new Date('2023-01-01'), new Date('2023-01-01')) // true\ndeepEquals(new Map([['a', 1]]), new Map([['a', 1]])) // true","lang":"typescript"}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"a","text":"a","level":3},{"id":"b","text":"b","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction deepEquals(a, b): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/utils.ts:29](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/utils.ts#L29)\n\nDeep equality function that compares two values recursively\nHandles primitives, objects, arrays, Date, RegExp, Map, Set, TypedArrays, and Temporal objects\n\n## Parameters\n\n### a\n\n`any`\n\nFirst value to compare\n\n### b\n\n`any`\n\nSecond value to compare\n\n## Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\nTrue if the values are deeply equal, false otherwise\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\ndeepEquals({ a: 1, b: 2 }, { b: 2, a: 1 }) // true (property order doesn't matter)\ndeepEquals([1, { x: 2 }], [1, { x: 2 }]) // true\ndeepEquals({ a: 1 }, { a: 2 }) // false\ndeepEquals(new Date('2023-01-01'), new Date('2023-01-01')) // true\ndeepEquals(new Map([['a', 1]]), new Map([['a', 1]])) // true\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: deepEquals\ntitle: deepEquals\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction deepEquals(a, b): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/utils.ts:29](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/utils.ts#L29)\n\nDeep equality function that compares two values recursively\nHandles primitives, objects, arrays, Date, RegExp, Map, Set, TypedArrays, and Temporal objects\n\n## Parameters\n\n### a\n\n`any`\n\nFirst value to compare\n\n### b\n\n`any`\n\nSecond value to compare\n\n## Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\nTrue if the values are deeply equal, false otherwise\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\ndeepEquals({ a: 1, b: 2 }, { b: 2, a: 1 }) // true (property order doesn't matter)\ndeepEquals([1, { x: 2 }], [1, { x: 2 }]) // true\ndeepEquals({ a: 1 }, { a: 2 }) // false\ndeepEquals(new Date('2023-01-01'), new Date('2023-01-01')) // true\ndeepEquals(new Map([['a', 1]]), new Map([['a', 1]])) // true\n```\n"}
